scene the_last_train
  [[show backdrop int_subway_aisle@night with screenfade]]
  ((stop ambient over 2))
  $: INT. SUBWAY CAR, LINE 4 - NIGHT

  The last train rattles out of the city. The friends have the whole car to themselves.

  THEO:
    [[theo:happy]]
    Line 4 goes all the way to the end. I've never been past Elm Street.

  [[show backdrop int_subway_window@night with fade over 1]]
  The streetlights thin out. Then there is only dark, and their own reflections in the glass.

  IMANI:
    [[imani:sad]]
    Whoever plays that song wants someone to ride this train.

  MARCUS:
    [[marcus:happy]]
    (finally uncrossing his arms)
    Okay. Maybe it's not a prank.

  They fall asleep somewhere past the river.

  [[show backdrop int_subway_window@day with fade over 2]]
  When they wake, the window is full of green hills and morning light.

  -> grandmas_cottage
end
